  "body_html": "<p>Bring the energy of the court into your bedroom with the sports-themed bedding by Jeminise. This personalized comforter set features a dynamic design, making it a perfect gift for basketball players, kids, and sports fans of all ages.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your own Name and Number for a truly unique sports bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling that prevents clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Craftsmanship:</strong> Features smooth, fine, and compact stitching along the edges with advanced printing techniques to prevent fading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Sizing:</strong> Available in multiple sizes including US Twin, Full, Queen, and King to fit any bed perfectly.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Basketball D15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Art, Number, Personalized</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs (Name and Number)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
